extends layout.pug

block content
  h1(style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -0.02em;")
    | Verify your account
  p(style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #475569;")
    if userName
      | Hi #[strong #{userName}], 
    else
      | Hello, 
    | use the following One-Time Password (OTP) to complete your verification. This code is valid for #[strong 5 minutes].

  //- OTP Code Box
  div(style="margin: 24px 0; padding: 20px 16px; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;")
    span(style="display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 8px;")
      | One-Time Code
    span(style="display: inline-block; font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #0f172a; user-select: all;")
      = otp

  p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #64748b;")
    | If you did not request this verification, please disregard this email. No changes will be made to your account.

